ame to react to the game and to recap the rest of Week 4.", "refs": ["rss:8b88f966-bd12-11f1-ad9a-23c6fc8548cf"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 183.8, "d": 3.9, "text": "Then, they guess the lines for Week 5 before ending with Parent Corner.", "refs": ["rss:8b88f966-bd12-11f1-ad9a-23c6fc8548cf"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 188.0, "d": 13.94, "text": "Saturday, from Moonshots with Peter Diamandis: Recursive's 670 million dollar Bet on Self-Improving A.I., Sonnet 5.5 Hits 70%, Elon Co-Leads Pentagon Push episode 299.", "refs": ["yt:Blyb1D927pM"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 202.24, "d": 17.21, "text": "The mates sit down with Richard Socher to discuss Recursive’s 670 million dollar bet on self-improving A.I., why he puts P of doom at zero, the race toward ASI, proposed restrictions on recursive self-improvement, and what new A.I. benchmarks like Tavus’ Turing Test could tell us about what comes next.", "refs": ["yt:Blyb1D927pM"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 219.75, "d": 8.52, "text": "Friday, from the All-In Podcast: Trump’s Super Intelligence Summit, A.I. Safety Accord, GDP Beats, Midterm Predictions.", "refs": ["yt:ZJKs08oU1zg"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 228.57, "d": 9.0, "text": "Friday, from Moonshots with Peter Diamandis: Why A.I. Leaders Have Changed Their Minds About A.I. Safety, Elon on UHI, Anthropic’s IPO.", "refs": ["yt:mZh8IUuNnvs"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 237.87, "d": 16.96, "text": "The mates sit down with Emad Mostaque to discuss the shifting debate around A.I. safety, whether we can still “win safely,” the case for A.I. optimism, Elon Musk’s vision for abundance and universal high income, Anthropic’s reported 2 trillion dollar IPO ambitions, and the White House’s proposed A.I. accord.", "refs": ["yt:mZh8IUuNnvs"], "seg": "week"}, {"t": 255.13, "d": 11.55, "text": "Friday, from Bill Simmons and The Ringer: Hello Cleveland, Week 4 NFL Picks, NBA Award Leans, Raiders Realities, and Boston Despair With Joe House, Tom Pelissero, and Bill’s dad.", "refs": ["rss:8b690bce-bd12-11f1-ad9a-b